detailInfo.detail:
Mark. [Sleep] cannot be interrupted in its duration. 
✦ When being inflicted again or the duration is over, 20% of all DMG taken in [Labyrinth of Dreams I] duration is calculated, which should not exceed 400% M.ATK of the caster;
✦ When being inflicted again, additionally deals [piercing DMG] equal to 20% of the caster's M.ATK. This instance of DMG can be counted as DMG taken in the [Labyrinth of Dreams I] duration. This effect cannot be dispelled or immunized.

Mark. [Sleep] cannot be interrupted in its duration.
✦ When being inflicted again or the duration is over, 30% of all DMG taken in [Labyrinth of Dreams II] duration is calculated, which should not exceed 600% M.ATK of the caster;
✦ When being inflicted again, additionally deals [piercing DMG] equal to 30% of the caster's M.ATK; this instance of DMG can be counted as DMG taken in the [Labyrinth of Dreams II] duration. This effect cannot be dispelled or immunized.
